The '''2024 Baliscan premiership election''' was held on 1 December 2024 to elect the [[Secretary General of Balisca]]. It was the first confederal election under the [[Constitution of Balisca|2022 constitution]], and took place following the [[2024 Baliscan confederal election]]. The [[Confederal Left]] (EC) federation of [[List of platforms in Balisca|platforms]] endorsed interim Secretary General Bilal to be re-elected.

A total of 88 million people voted in the election, reaching a voter turnout of 80.5%.

